    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Bleached</strong></i> is a point-and-click interactive story about life and color. When every day looks the same, tints slowly fade. One day, your canvas is empty. Can you paint something new?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recolor the world around you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your environment is turning white... and painting new shades isn't so simple. With time, perhaps new strokes can bring new perspectives.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589870/extras/65e03c1c148cd9e039c2a74fad7329a4.poster.avif?t=1743368252\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589870/extras/65e03c1c148cd9e039c2a74fad7329a4.webm?t=1743368252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589870/extras/65e03c1c148cd9e039c2a74fad7329a4.mp4?t=1743368252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Point and click on anything.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk around, talk to friends and colleagues, take care of pets, play minigames. Everything in the scenery is interactive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589870/extras/ce2380820ab64a87a17e9be6947ee9d1.poster.avif?t=1743368252\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589870/extras/ce2380820ab64a87a17e9be6947ee9d1.webm?t=1743368252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589870/extras/ce2380820ab64a87a17e9be6947ee9d1.mp4?t=1743368252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wake up. Work. Sleep. Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day is the exact same picture, except that your relationships\u2014with yourself and others\u2014evolve.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589870/extras/2bf94d16f69eeb37520e4918c63c8778.poster.avif?t=1743368252\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589870/extras/2bf94d16f69eeb37520e4918c63c8778.webm?t=1743368252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589870/extras/2bf94d16f69eeb37520e4918c63c8778.mp4?t=1743368252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
